{"seq":4,"slug":"analytical-patterns","title":"分析函数实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/analytical-patterns","wordCount":676,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"分析函数实战\">分析函数实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQL 分析函数（Analytical Functions）是数据分析和报表场景的核心工具。它们将窗口函数、聚合函数和高级 SQL 特性组合使用，解决时序分析、漏斗分析、留存分析、排行榜等实际业务问题。本文聚焦于真实业务场景中的分析模式，展示如何用纯 SQL 完成通常需要 Python/Pandas 才能实现的数据分析工作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[业务分析场景] --&gt; B[时序分析]&#10;    A --&gt; C[漏斗分析]&#10;    A --&gt; D[留存分析]&#10;    A --&gt; E[排行与分桶]&#10;    A --&gt; F[会话分析]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[同比/环比]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[移动平均]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[累计趋势]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[转化率计算]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[步骤流失]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[N 日留存]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[队列分析]\">graph TD\n    A[业务分析场景] --&gt; B[时序分析]\n    A --&gt; C[漏斗分析]\n    A --&gt; D[留存分析]\n    A --&gt; E[排行与分桶]\n    A --&gt; F[会话分析]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[同比/环比]\n    B --&gt; B2[移动平均]\n    B --&gt; B3[累计趋势]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[转化率计算]\n    C --&gt; C2[步骤流失]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[N 日留存]\n    D --&gt; D2[队列分析]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析场景</th>\n<th>核心 SQL 特性</th>\n<th>常用函数</th>\n<th>输出形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序分析</td>\n<td>窗口函数 + LAG/LEAD</td>\n<td>LAG, SUM OVER</td>\n<td>时间序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏斗分析</td>\n<td>条件聚合 + CASE</td>\n<td>COUNT + CASE WHEN</td>\n<td>步骤转化表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>留存分析</td>\n<td>自连接 + DATE_TRUNC</td>\n<td>COUNT DISTINCT</td>\n<td>留存矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排行/分桶</td>\n<td>RANK + NTILE</td>\n<td>ROW_NUMBER, NTILE</td>\n<td>排名列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话分析</td>\n<td>条件窗口 + 累计</td>\n<td>SUM OVER + CASE</td>\n<td>会话标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时序分析\">时序分析</h2><p>时序分析是最常见的数据分析场景，涵盖同比、环比、移动平均和趋势检测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const timeSeriesAnalysis = `&#10;-- 日级营收 + 7 天移动平均 + 环比增长&#10;WITH daily_revenue AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        DATE_TRUNC(&#39;day&#39;, created_at)::DATE AS day,&#10;        SUM(amount) AS revenue,&#10;        COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS unique_buyers&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-01-01&#39;&#10;    GROUP BY 1&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    day,&#10;    revenue,&#10;    unique_buyers,&#10;    AVG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY day ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) &#10;        AS moving_avg_7d,&#10;    LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY day) AS prev_day_revenue,&#10;    ROUND(&#10;        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY day)) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY day), 0), &#10;        2&#10;    ) AS dod_growth_pct,&#10;    LAG(revenue, 7) OVER (ORDER BY day) AS same_day_last_week,&#10;    ROUND(&#10;        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 7) OVER (ORDER BY day)) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 7) OVER (ORDER BY day), 0), &#10;        2&#10;    ) AS wow_growth_pct&#10;FROM daily_revenue&#10;ORDER BY day;&#10;&#10;-- 月度同比分析&#10;WITH monthly AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, created_at)::DATE AS month,&#10;        SUM(amount) AS revenue&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    GROUP BY 1&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    month,&#10;    revenue,&#10;    LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS same_month_last_year,&#10;    ROUND(&#10;        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month)) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month), 0), &#10;        2&#10;    ) AS yoy_growth_pct&#10;FROM monthly;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timeSeriesAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 日级营收 + 7 天移动平均 + 环比增长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH daily_revenue AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at)::DATE AS day,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SUM(amount) AS revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS unique_buyers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE created_at >= '2024-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    day,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    unique_buyers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY day ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        AS moving_avg_7d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY day) AS prev_day_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY day)) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY day), 0), </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS dod_growth_pct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAG(revenue, 7) OVER (ORDER BY day) AS same_day_last_week,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 7) OVER (ORDER BY day)) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 7) OVER (ORDER BY day), 0), </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS wow_growth_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM daily_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY day;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 月度同比分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH monthly AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at)::DATE AS month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SUM(amount) AS revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS same_month_last_year,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month)) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month), 0), </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS yoy_growth_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM monthly;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"漏斗分析\">漏斗分析</h2><p>漏斗分析跟踪用户在多步骤流程中的转化率和流失点。核心技巧是使用条件聚合（CASE WHEN）配合窗口函数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const funnelAnalysis = `&#10;-- 电商购买漏斗：浏览 → 加购 → 下单 → 支付&#10;WITH user_events AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = &#39;page_view&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS viewed,&#10;        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = &#39;add_to_cart&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS added,&#10;        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = &#39;checkout&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS checked_out,&#10;        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = &#39;payment&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS paid&#10;    FROM events&#10;    WHERE created_at &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    &#39;浏览&#39; AS step,&#10;    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1) AS users,&#10;    100.0 AS pct_of_first&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT &#10;    &#39;加购&#39;,&#10;    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE added = 1),&#10;    ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE added = 1) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1), 0), 2)&#10;FROM user_events&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT &#10;    &#39;下单&#39;,&#10;    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE checked_out = 1),&#10;    ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE checked_out = 1) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1), 0), 2)&#10;FROM user_events&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT &#10;    &#39;支付&#39;,&#10;    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE paid = 1),&#10;    ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE paid = 1) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1), 0), 2)&#10;FROM user_events;&#10;&#10;-- 带时间约束的严格漏斗（步骤必须按顺序发生）&#10;WITH ordered_events AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        event_type,&#10;        created_at,&#10;        LEAD(event_type) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS next_event,&#10;        LEAD(created_at) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS next_time&#10;    FROM events&#10;    WHERE event_type IN (&#39;page_view&#39;, &#39;add_to_cart&#39;, &#39;checkout&#39;, &#39;payment&#39;)&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    event_type AS from_step,&#10;    next_event AS to_step,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS transitions,&#10;    AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (next_time - created_at))) AS avg_seconds&#10;FROM ordered_events&#10;WHERE next_event IS NOT NULL&#10;GROUP BY event_type, next_event;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> funnelAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 电商购买漏斗：浏览 → 加购 → 下单 → 支付</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH user_events AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = 'page_view' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS viewed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = 'add_to_cart' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS added,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = 'checkout' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS checked_out,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = 'payment' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS paid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE created_at >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '浏览' AS step,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1) AS users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    100.0 AS pct_of_first</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '加购',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE added = 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE added = 1) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1), 0), 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM user_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '下单',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE checked_out = 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE checked_out = 1) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1), 0), 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM user_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '支付',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE paid = 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE paid = 1) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE viewed = 1), 0), 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM user_events;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 带时间约束的严格漏斗（步骤必须按顺序发生）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH ordered_events AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        created_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LEAD(event_type) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS next_event,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LEAD(created_at) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS next_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE event_type IN ('page_view', 'add_to_cart', 'checkout', 'payment')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    event_type AS from_step,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    next_event AS to_step,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS transitions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (next_time - created_at))) AS avg_seconds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM ordered_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE next_event IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY event_type, next_event;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"留存分析\">留存分析</h2><p>留存分析衡量用户在首次行为后的回访率。经典的 N 日留存通过队列分析（Cohort Analysis）实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const retentionAnalysis = `&#10;-- N 日留存矩阵&#10;WITH first_visit AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        MIN(DATE_TRUNC(&#39;day&#39;, created_at))::DATE AS cohort_date&#10;    FROM events&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;),&#10;user_activity AS (&#10;    SELECT DISTINCT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        DATE_TRUNC(&#39;day&#39;, created_at)::DATE AS active_date&#10;    FROM events&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    fv.cohort_date,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT fv.user_id) AS cohort_size,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 1 &#10;        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_1,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 3 &#10;        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_3,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 7 &#10;        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_7,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 30 &#10;        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_30,&#10;    ROUND(&#10;        COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 7 &#10;            THEN ua.user_id END) * 100.0 &#10;        / COUNT(DISTINCT fv.user_id), 2&#10;    ) AS retention_7d_pct&#10;FROM first_visit fv&#10;LEFT JOIN user_activity ua ON fv.user_id = ua.user_id&#10;WHERE fv.cohort_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY fv.cohort_date&#10;ORDER BY fv.cohort_date;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retentionAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- N 日留存矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH first_visit AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MIN(DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at))::DATE AS cohort_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user_activity AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT DISTINCT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at)::DATE AS active_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    fv.cohort_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT fv.user_id) AS cohort_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 1 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 3 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 7 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_7,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 30 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        THEN ua.user_id END) AS day_30,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ua.active_date = fv.cohort_date + 7 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            THEN ua.user_id END) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / COUNT(DISTINCT fv.user_id), 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS retention_7d_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM first_visit fv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN user_activity ua ON fv.user_id = ua.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE fv.cohort_date >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY fv.cohort_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY fv.cohort_date;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>留存指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>业务意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>次日留存</td>\n<td>Day 1 活跃 / Day 0 新增</td>\n<td>首次体验质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 日留存</td>\n<td>Day 3 活跃 / Day 0 新增</td>\n<td>短期吸引力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7 日留存</td>\n<td>Day 7 活跃 / Day 0 新增</td>\n<td>核心留存基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30 日留存</td>\n<td>Day 30 活跃 / Day 0 新增</td>\n<td>长期价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"会话切割与分析\">会话切割与分析</h2><p>将连续的用户事件流切割为&quot;会话&quot;（Session），通常以 30 分钟无活动作为会话边界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const sessionAnalysis = `&#10;-- 基于时间间隔切割会话&#10;WITH event_gaps AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        event_type,&#10;        created_at,&#10;        LAG(created_at) OVER (&#10;            PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at&#10;        ) AS prev_event_at,&#10;        EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (&#10;            created_at - LAG(created_at) OVER (&#10;                PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at&#10;            )&#10;        )) / 60 AS gap_minutes&#10;    FROM events&#10;),&#10;session_marks AS (&#10;    SELECT *,&#10;        SUM(CASE WHEN gap_minutes IS NULL OR gap_minutes &gt; 30 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)&#10;            OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS session_id&#10;    FROM event_gaps&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    user_id,&#10;    session_id,&#10;    MIN(created_at) AS session_start,&#10;    MAX(created_at) AS session_end,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS event_count,&#10;    EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (MAX(created_at) - MIN(created_at))) / 60 AS duration_minutes&#10;FROM session_marks&#10;GROUP BY user_id, session_id;&#10;&#10;-- 会话级指标聚合&#10;WITH sessions AS (&#10;    -- ... (上面的会话切割逻辑)&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    DATE_TRUNC(&#39;day&#39;, session_start)::DATE AS day,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS total_sessions,&#10;    AVG(event_count) AS avg_events_per_session,&#10;    AVG(duration_minutes) AS avg_duration_minutes,&#10;    PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY duration_minutes) AS median_duration&#10;FROM sessions&#10;GROUP BY 1&#10;ORDER BY 1;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sessionAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 基于时间间隔切割会话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH event_gaps AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        created_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LAG(created_at) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ) AS prev_event_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            created_at - LAG(created_at) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        )) / 60 AS gap_minutes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">session_marks AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT *,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SUM(CASE WHEN gap_minutes IS NULL OR gap_minutes > 30 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS session_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM event_gaps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    session_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    MIN(created_at) AS session_start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    MAX(created_at) AS session_end,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS event_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (MAX(created_at) - MIN(created_at))) / 60 AS duration_minutes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM session_marks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY user_id, session_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 会话级指标聚合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH sessions AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    -- ... (上面的会话切割逻辑)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    DATE_TRUNC('day', session_start)::DATE AS day,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS total_sessions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(event_count) AS avg_events_per_session,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(duration_minutes) AS avg_duration_minutes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY duration_minutes) AS median_duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM sessions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[事件流] --&gt; B[计算间隔 LAG]&#10;    B --&gt; C[标记边界 CASE]&#10;    C --&gt; D[累计编号 SUM OVER]&#10;    D --&gt; E[按 session_id 聚合]&#10;    E --&gt; F[会话指标]\">graph LR\n    A[事件流] --&gt; B[计算间隔 LAG]\n    B --&gt; C[标记边界 CASE]\n    C --&gt; D[累计编号 SUM OVER]\n    D --&gt; E[按 session_id 聚合]\n    E --&gt; F[会话指标]</pre><p>会话切割的核心是 LAG + 条件累计求和的组合模式：先用 LAG 计算相邻事件的时间间隔，然后用 CASE 标记超过阈值的间隔为新会话起点，最后用 SUM OVER 累计生成会话 ID。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时序分析使用 LAG/LEAD 计算同比环比，窗口聚合实现移动平均和累计趋势</li>\n<li>漏斗分析通过条件聚合（CASE WHEN + COUNT）计算各步骤转化率</li>\n<li>留存分析的核心是队列分析，通过首次行为日期分组后计算 N 日回访率</li>\n<li>会话切割使用 LAG + 条件 SUM OVER 模式，以时间间隔阈值（如 30 分钟）划分会话</li>\n<li>FILTER (WHERE ...) 是 PostgreSQL 中条件聚合的简洁替代语法</li>\n<li>这些分析模式可以组合使用，如按会话维度做漏斗分析或按留存队列做时序趋势</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分析函数实战","id":"分析函数实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时序分析","id":"时序分析"},{"level":2,"text":"漏斗分析","id":"漏斗分析"},{"level":2,"text":"留存分析","id":"留存分析"},{"level":2,"text":"会话切割与分析","id":"会话切割与分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"JSON 与半结构化数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/json-semi-structured"},"next":{"title":"事务与并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/transactions"}}